02,"end":404,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m006-0416","start":416,"end":417,"surface":"邯","kind":"person","person_id":"p0f_9en_kjq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m006-0418","start":418,"end":419,"surface":"欣","kind":"person","person_id":"ji9_1mz_ffy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m006-0420","start":420,"end":421,"surface":"翳","kind":"person","person_id":"4es_tvz_kjv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m006-0424","start":424,"end":427,"surface":"秦父兄","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定指代保留原文，不補姓名成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m006-0547","start":547,"end":549,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m006-0556","start":556,"end":557,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m006-0561","start":561,"end":562,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin","book_id":"b-shiji-092","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-092-hanxin"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p017","text":"楚已亡龍且，項王恐，使盱眙人武涉往說齊王信曰：『天下共苦秦久矣，相與勠力擊秦。秦已破，計功割地，分土而王之，以休士卒。今漢王復興兵而東，侵人之分，奪人之地，已破三秦，引兵出關，收諸侯之兵以東擊楚，其意非盡吞天下者不休，其不知厭足如是甚也。且漢王不可必，身居項王掌握中數矣，項王憐而活之，然得脫，輒倍約，復擊項王，其不可親信如此。今足下雖自以與漢王爲厚交，爲之盡力用兵，終爲之所禽矣。足下所以得須臾至今者，以項王尚存也。當今二王之事，權在足下。足下右投則漢王勝，左投則項王勝。項王今日亡，則次取足下。足下與項王有故，何不反漢與楚連和，參分天下王之？今釋此時，而自必於漢以擊楚，且爲智者固若此乎！』韓信謝曰：『臣事項王，官不過郎中，位不過執戟，言不聽，畫不用，故倍楚而歸漢。漢王授我上將軍印，予我數萬眾，解衣衣我，推食食我，言聽計用，故吾得以至於此。夫人深親信我，我倍之不祥，雖死不易。幸爲信謝項王！』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"xxs_ub0_7rv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"武涉","kind":"person","person_id":"49t_1cr_hfa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"齊王信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0237","start":237,"end":239,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0252","start":252,"end":254,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0305","start":305,"end":307,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0335","start":335,"end":337,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0393","start":393,"end":394,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0395","start":395,"end":397,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"47s_3n9_u3c","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin","book_id":"b-shiji-092","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-092-hanxin"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p019","text":"韓信曰：『漢王遇我甚厚，載我以其車，衣我以其衣，食我以其食。吾聞之，乘人之車者載人之患，衣人之衣者懷人之憂，食人之食者死人之事，吾豈可以鄉利倍義乎！』蒯生曰：『足下自以爲善漢王，欲建萬世之業，臣竊以爲誤矣。始常山王、成安君爲布衣時，相與爲刎頸之交，後爭張黶、陳澤之事，二人相怨。常山王背項王，奉項嬰頭而竄，逃歸於漢王。漢王借兵而東下，殺成安君泜水之南，頭足異處，卒爲天下笑。此二人相與，天下至驩也。然而卒相禽者，何也？患生於多欲而人心難測也。今足下欲行忠信以交於漢王，必不能固於二君之相與也，而事多大於張黶、陳澤。故臣以爲足下必漢王之不危己，亦誤矣。大夫種、范蠡存亡越，霸句踐，立功成名而身死亡。野獸已盡而獵狗亨。夫以交友言之，則不如張耳之與成安君者也；以忠信言之，則不過大夫種、范蠡之於句踐也。此二人者，足以觀矣。願足下深慮之。且臣聞勇略震主者身危，而功蓋天下者不賞。臣請言大王功略：足下涉西河，虜魏王，禽夏說，引兵下井陘，誅成安君，徇趙，脅燕，定齊，南摧楚人之兵二十萬，東殺龍且，西鄉以報，此所謂功無二於天下，而略不世出者也。今足下戴震主之威，挾不賞之功，歸楚，楚人不信；歸漢，漢人震恐：足下欲持是安歸乎？夫勢在人臣之位而有震主之威，名髙天下，竊爲足下危之。』韓信謝曰：『先生且休矣，吾將念之。』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m019-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"v8v_2nz_wdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m019-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cz8_no4_4jl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m019-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"蒯生","kind":"per